 .../DVDCodecs/Video/DVDVideoCodec.cpp         | 14 +++++++++++++
 .../DVDCodecs/Video/DVDVideoCodec.h           |  6 ++++++
 .../DVDCodecs/Video/DVDVideoCodecFFmpeg.cpp   |  9 +++++---
